{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub032_youngf_01",
      "hash": "fe033ea1b308fe8f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 0]"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub032_youngf_02",
      "hash": "fe033fa1b3090042",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我偶尔\\n会去深灰市购物。\\c\\n每次去都要经过\\n常青森林那拐来拐去的路呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub032_oldm_01",
      "hash": "1978755f4e6ce301",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub032_oldm_02",
      "hash": "1978725f4e6cdde8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "如果你在收集图鉴的话，\\n我就给你个建议好了！\\c\\n到友好商店预先多买些精灵球，\\n绝对没有坏处唷！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub032_musashi_01",
      "hash": "9768d2491369333f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：干嘛！不行不行！\\n这里现在禁止通行！\\c\\n我们正在执行\\n重要的把风任务呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub032_musashi_02",
      "hash": "9768d349136934f2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：我都说了！\\n这里现在禁止通行啦！\\c\\n小朋友还是快点回去\\n帮爸爸妈妈打酱油去吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub032_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "98c6fe975db79e1d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：这个小鬼头是怎么回事？\\n……嘘！去那边玩儿去！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub032_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "98c6fb975db79904",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？：虽然说是在执行任务，\\n可是站在这里把风太无聊了……\\c\\n好想去友好商店\\n愉快地偷个懒啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub032_nyasu_01",
      "hash": "0edc7c7055db0f77",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喵喵：喵～～"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_oyaji4_01_p03_field_t002",
      "hash": "85a5a580612c233f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 9]"
    },
